	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Current querry postgres 8.4]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=27125#p27125"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />Je dirais que votre user n&#039;est pas superuser à priori. D&#039;après la doc : &quot;The columns that report data on the current query are available unless the parameter track_activities has been turned off. Furthermore, these columns are only visible if the user examining the view is a superuser or the same as the user owning the process being reported on&quot;.<br />Julien.</p>]]></content>
